{
    "title": "QuizUp 2",
    "description": "Enjoy the second version of online trivia game QuizUp 2, and compete with your friends and new players worldwide, in exciting real-time trivia matches online for fun in order to see who knows the most about different topics.\r\n\r\n  Join a community of millions already playing the biggest trivia game in the world! Battle of brains and meet new people who share your interests. \r\n\r\n   QuizUp 2  is an entertaining multiplayer game to outsmart players from all over the world. The competition is in 7 rounds of timed multiple choice questions of various topics.\r\n\r\nOne of QuizUp 2's strong points is its social aspect, which allows you to earn experience and pass levels as you participate in games and win. In addition, you can challenge your best friends or try to compete against strangers online.\r\n\r\nQuizUp 2 is an excellent online trivia game that allows you to compete against friends and strangers and learn as you do so. In addition, it includes an extra bit of competition thanks to the fact that it has different levels.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Enjoy the second version of online trivia game QuizUp 2, and compete with your friends and new players worldwide, in exciting real-time trivia matches online for fun in order to see who knows the most about different topics.<br><br>  Join a community of millions already playing the biggest trivia game in the world! Battle of brains and meet new people who share your interests. <br><br>   QuizUp 2  is an entertaining multiplayer game to outsmart players from all over the world. The competition is in 7 rounds of timed multiple choice questions of various topics.<br><br>One of QuizUp 2&#39;s strong points is its social aspect, which allows you to earn experience and pass levels as you participate in games and win. In addition, you can challenge your best friends or try to compete against strangers online.<br><br>QuizUp 2 is an excellent online trivia game that allows you to compete against friends and strangers and learn as you do so. In addition, it includes an extra bit of competition thanks to the fact that it has different levels.",
